      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GORDON KEEPING (1) boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten a neck (30.95) behind Twisted Truth at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. RUN THE GAUNTLET (3) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for 11 wins and six minors. Recorded a nose win (30.87) in a Grade 5/6 last time at this track. Looks one of the chances. OUTPLAYED (2) turned in a fair run last time from an unfavourable draw finishing fourth by 4.5 lengths (25.60). Has ability and is one of the better chances. BLACK TIGER (8) was in the money again last start when third at Mandurah (37.73).",
